&lt;li&gt;Proficient in reading/interpreting blueprints, GD&amp;amp;T, and engineering drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled with precision measuring tools (micrometers, calipers, bore gauges, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
