&lt;li&gt;Ability to&amp;nbsp;lift up&amp;nbsp;to 50&amp;nbsp;lbs&amp;nbsp;and stand for extended periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented, enthusiastic, and eager to learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have the ability to obtain and maintain a U.S. government Secret/Top Secret security clearance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
