&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2898&quot; data-local-id=&quot;32501f7fd381&quot;&gt;Experience in harness design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2930&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0bbe9b97ca7b&quot;&gt;Experience with 3d printing and other rapid-prototyping technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3002&quot; data-local-id=&quot;167cbf89b09d&quot;&gt;Proficiency in one or more scripting languages (Python, Lua, Bash, PowerShell, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
