&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Reentry Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inversion is an aerospace and defense company pioneering advanced reentry technology to enable next-generation capabilities from space. By combining high-performance materials, precision aerodynamics, and mission-driven autonomy, Inversion is transforming reentry into an operational capability for an entirely new class of missions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company’s highly maneuverable reentry spacecraft, Arc, is designed for rapid global cargo delivery, hypersonic testing, and other national security missions that require precise, controlled flight through the atmosphere. Arc creates an entirely new transportation domain, unlocking unprecedented speed and global reach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Los Angeles, Inversion designs, manufactures, and integrates its spacecraft under one roof, enabling the company to move rapidly from concept to flight. The company is backed by leading investors including Y Combinator, Spark Capital, and Lockheed Martin Ventures, with customers across the U.S. government and commercial space industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW231896756 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW231896756 BCX8&quot;&gt;Position Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Senior Dynamics Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at Inversion, you will own the development of loads, structural dynamics, and multibody dynamics analyses for one of the most capable reentry vehicles ever developed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;work across vehicle architecture, structures, mechanisms, and test to define critical dynamic environments, mature structural and deployment system designs, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;validate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;key aspects of vehicle performance through analysis and hardware correlation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to shape the dynamic behavior of a new aerospace vehicle from early concept through qualification and production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own development of vehicle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;loads, structural dynamics, and multibody dynamics analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; from early architecture through hardware realization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and mature&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;load cases and dynamic environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, including launch, shock, vibration, separation, deployment, and other transient mechanical events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;multibody dynamics models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to evaluate separation events&amp;nbsp;and other critical mechanism-driven vehicle behaviors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with structures and mechanisms engineers to translate dynamic analysis results into&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;design requirements, sizing inputs, interface loads, and architecture decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support development of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;structural dynamics models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, including modal characterization, transient response, and dynamic load prediction for flight hardware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive dynamic trade studies to evaluate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;mechanism architecture, deployment performance, structural response, and system sensitivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; under uncertain and evolving design conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help define&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;test&amp;nbsp;objectives, instrumentation needs, and correlation plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for mechanism, structural, and dynamic development tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Correlate simulation results to test data and refine models, assumptions, and design recommendations based on hardware learnings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Present analysis progress, technical risks, and recommended paths forward in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;design reviews and cross-functional program forums.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Operate effectively in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;fast-paced, ambiguous development environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, balancing model fidelity, engineering judgment, and schedule needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;8196cb6b-cd51-5eab-845a-560d08e94671|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;text-start&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;text-start&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Aerospace Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;, Mechanical Engineering, Engineering Mechanics, a related field, or equivalent technical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Typically&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years of professional experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; in loads, structural dynamics, multibody dynamics, or related analysis for aerospace, defense, or similarly demanding applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong fundamentals in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; rigid-body dynamics, structural dynamics, vibration, transient response, and mechanical system behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience developing and applying&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;multibody dynamics models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for mechanisms, deployment systems, separation events, or other complex dynamic hardware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience defining and evaluating&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;mechanical loads and dynamic environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for flight hardware or other high-consequence systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with finite element analysis tools such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ANSYS, Abaqus, NASTRAN, FEMAP, or equivalent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, with emphasis on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;modal, transient, and dynamic structural analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
