&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in the design, analysis, or test of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;qualified flight hardware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working on first-of-kind or highly integrated aerospace systems in an&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ambiguous, fast-moving development environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience scripting or automating analysis workflows using&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Python, MATLAB, or similar tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our office headquarters is located in Playa Vista, CA. This position requires in office presence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
