&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You thrive in fast-paced, ambiguous environments,&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;needs before they arise, and bring structure to chaos. You are equally comfortable coordinating board meetings, managing sensitive information, and jumping in to solve operational problems on the fly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
