&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead complex test campaigns to demonstrate system performance under representative environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;test plans, procedures, success criteria, and test readiness documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for mechanical development and validation activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
