&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with structures, mechanisms, dynamics, and manufacturing engineers to ensure test articles, fixtures, and instrumentation support key technical objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
