&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead troubleshooting and issue resolution during test preparation and execution, and drive rapid turnaround on test learnings into follow-on hardware or procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
